kdna-activation-server
Copyright 2026 KDNA Authors

This product includes software developed at
https://github.com/aikdna/kdna-activation-server

This package provides a co-located current entitlement-store observer
for the public KDNA reference Host. The deployment owns the store,
identity binding and policy. The observer supplies process-local context
and policy observations; it has no standalone server, CLI or issuer
signing service.

See LICENSE for the full Apache 2.0 license text. See README.md
for the observer embedding guide and the API contract.
